    "so the data now matches the config key and no alias is needed. Setting DbLabName back to a",
    "PCR value after re-stamping would break the lab, not fix it.",
    "",
    "Paths point at demo folders on purpose. Left on PCR's folders the demo reads PCR's live",
    "CSVs, Excel exports and insight JSON - production data again, which the database scrub",
    "does nothing about. Copy the files across once from PCR's folders.",
    "",
    "THE DEMO DATABASE IS LRNDemoLab ON THE AZURE MANAGED INSTANCE, and it is a clone of COVE,",
    "not of PCR - it carries Cove_* tables and usp_GetCove_* procedures. The code resolves that",
    "through LabLogicAlias, which maps LRNLabDemo to Cove for prefixes, the claim column set and",
    "the LIS template. A LRNLabDemo database also exists on ReportEngine\\SQLEXPRESS and is an",
    "older PCR clone: pointing this config at it brings back the empty reports, because the alias",
    "asks for Cove objects that database does not have. If the demo is ever re-cloned from a",
    "different lab, change the alias to match - one entry, not five prefix maps.",
    "",
    "Every report is ON. A demo lab with a page switched off shows the audience a product that",
    "does not have that page."
